{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/333d3fa148d14a6e5a7f44212b5c4afae7198912313b2d17e72ba70e3929111ebdfef17492816197f993e1bfcb42e91615af7ff70fce6f75d9df69400d2c53c2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2642884c448db7caceaa921a22f9a60296c69bbe0d3deaf84d9b8d4272e27f01a0e0a9beae56209f42f7faae619d01cfac7ac07881fd53c0eb24f7ec6b74cbbbc3fa68d8fb2c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b17c9342139e288997ea4ea27fabaee1ac0fec71f6d24dbe1b663f6b7145cc41ca71c0b8658c7bd88aff25cd45ae4ff1e011fdb60ae146eff913d87c801f45a0d3e91c126a6062e4d35744821b45aadf45650a92062a3fd6bec3bae6892b3fa61b77d95159aa320b509052be672389e63d60e6096e23c55b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2d6548ce9232173dadb357d220548c95fc2860e76093302ecffda65e9b5e887200ad6cdb0c47528fbb4a3b2d0a4cbff70142bc3b83f13a600bf6647741e7e05dee66da35f68c5469c9ef3f499aff70339e67b23023ded4a5e7ae09b73da5f67b4ebde64d4f736e79a512bf2ffe6f00d1163a0d381f3fd2fb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e119c97cc6b3184f69655eb13a28d26c9aa53327c24ac57134426b492adf9c1637ef46d78f8d66b7ad3d4e53f7c2fe8e0b3e094637eabe303922d28d72a87dfc1e5fdb7d2455f4059c878bbfa6d8349ccae903730b4e5f17ed285dd15bfebacbec73d451fbf983d328158c99d66996ce1ad489eda77db783\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cf2c21beb84174f682164982ae35741fa85ae718d0478f8fa6cc56fb973e9b57ce7df8bac77077169ec8bda8f547ff4e78aed5eaaea58df3f6d2356d4086c227368912cb15c8c5e7c471af88ca3bc45a1673cca417f21fe0f49e6428c80c0e2e9e4fba26ad57350ad61942ca3aeb767590742b8f48e4192f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c00c32edd4df80da63e042d869e00a5b8d1ba6d05edb0afcd7010ccc9f4795a87b91c2e3dad5b0ed27e1b0a9caadcf50817a7f3a1e54a39e3498bd16b28756157ddc7bb7072f2d5121dbbe65bceb25b9e72f4663392a3003d17b454036e13a8c53440b7fbd82dbdeff77b0aef2878086843c098ae876cbf8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e08ce68139a3be09167aac50b493772c166ab574024f3c5a8cfce75d37a7382d51e42287a3038419c899e1477f3c26a5c61076\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6c37d91d336f90d58da9d7a83f491c0b31e5a5bc3a6be4f7499f3a50a818e81f90013da34348eb24380ae3c9bd6c36ba8ec7e57e7e7d4edd4e8788cbca77f37a899401e421b1e721094aa4577d5e979c2e772903835f7674ca02d1cdfe2ba829084d6f1446574678804baea3e2ca5f5d2009f8b6413aa0b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7e59929279c00a499fce52e3cf6794cd97b0b19ccbb0d04d35816feac92ed203705f8fd87057354b5ce07dc44c31dc8ec2aca0ca89473d6557bef2a1d8801dec9c0ab2f950968136ea09d7f8401dc4aa33d74553b2c2ce2ff9306c100f28f85feaa52679e97bc701abb62ed592499c75ac0801c5503fe2c7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2b9518015e1e350e43d4d2a389a30df05e231d624d58d62915a657e3886cd6a32f57374b3a326284177fed3be66298bfd095caf028502144bdd27674491e77ca9e06708b1bf92e911fdc44bc9f79846305371fe41b5589c002b1d4d44f308c0d3fc745f129dac606eaf45c327065eaeadbec4441f67f3837\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ca0a5ad24ca8b60ab3912379ab0822f58be08240715a5129f3c0351ae8f4391b60e9d18f5ceffee69d48161c95eb130e27d6cb92d3156af67dece411a6923be95e82b155af4d3e6f97e646c01b735ca3b34283ba9e7fe0f8df4a0769ae9e51bf41a3fbeee7df62720a16527385c03505338df7f7a447c383\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a246feeacf4291e0bc4ea0d6cff5de54d5e22ab2357649829ca0a85987b9370d9bd4b015ab6268c4181fbeebd74bf777583d51a525c1016e5a099087f72100f1f10ab211e6fc14b449dbf042765998a4f4ccfdbdc1f2f7c89d8ba36899ac90004c60ffc66138a9077510acac1a4fdef78c86f8b212622802\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ed50ac935be4a407c8ae12151d3365da498c5da65eccec53c318d8ca4603100236b16b06630922f844a99b0d7986275013351c33ceaa014afb7d9fe5b26926a7cf7a0f094ba57a7144a2d9ffcadc79da1bc826fc0187e4131e950db1d938e36a2ce48fb72a9bbda076b45986ab806de79444f6a205d74e39\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d67a66708fdccffc7ef9e320d4d7227b9aa31afbfd92421d2bd8e8d9523b592d68ad0d496cc0e32f2b008ce736e5b55b32a65e72045f442f519ccc7cee89305d0d465a1b0e7b4446bed2fce374ddcaebf3ec309466ec91267c229fac60289c520085d1a7f5035d216658b2e23c850a215607ceaaee835ecd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/91011ead5607049864fa833866d2d6904a47019e38437c862b56e46e702a6b81475bbdd95e4905f022b72046dc2537f596441f4c287de2e68477bce28da62e1a6722a488c33e05692055156672dd379b97dda4b6ebc378aeb681c61e18c77ea806ce1f204114caf20a2931b5d48aa275e58a389862841dee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0e94cf121bc726eb9834e1e9a36ab6008343aef1dbfb98c9a9c9005c9eb74ff85acd2a87a271b9189742cc2d747cc605a691911add302b008a949f30ff8717d92881e055484c6701d842fe2a828b4af2a3e0af57006975d774a201c18b01f9fca3c2fb80ac819e1fad1d300723bab2395edce418d11db093\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6ce7f2fa23ec6c957a2a1c41df2570656a8e1ab88a6156672f22a21d85e5ed7132d63f316bd53f73455a44d4373d8ea3abef61a0b1a6240e1bea69721e09555098c5def880c73e16645ce11bc69b4430fb119c1d304bef527ce5cebb931a9c8a4436fa44536fc14455b7db9eb09a6ea533e15109f881546d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dcff4290c24b3a5dab5acd935082366416874203d326aa690ea57c07d03efaeb869c685d6352b7310bdcf5dd7cda7f1b0efeab8c7a5b205d38224f08c98aa4698210dae259167bcbf7de5d2b701c00f2a2e4c24714197806e7d1498b76aeaf8a5ed6014bf4c8e6538d1da87336fc93b19380239e5c92d62e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9f441b47f66c1464a754182302aa70555652a4851dfba77d896cfd0a6ece6cdd70e1c86411611fc5e33dc48ebf08afa342f50989678bcf7e113f425096e135709e83e13f167b4c4312749f9d3b3bbb1fab2bf22de496b8fda07999368f2c74be4ff6927b49f1989c6a909fcc2127e811a949d99a28521630\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/55bb1ce26c3bbbb8929d12be12342cf33ec4ba36bc10baa7945ef7b55c95e2838a175577b370a674ecfe900348190f2e852db56f12f68485a313f0eb70f88ac40b5c983420842c6fc6f2eed49b6bc10da8d36b69304934ed6fcd4d7f016409aa090b1c5cb361a8612ff1f61dfacddc7069b8b614793dec28\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8b9693357df41c02c3f64e26f915932a3b8d94008332086763d60efc8ef9ff53bb860c0f121fc23882a5a65620225bc827ed723234c09ac0d762d487d6e623cb285695aea9c604d9539f5b72f1ea8bc98c43b7e08b70cd407a388bdda080987828b9ecf6010a03577f37bc8aae77fb6c47c8090eac31e172\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1057cfb6faf604f3b1454c41cf97765b2683935c691d9cbfc9710b1be40f095714013ae816ac7703d1f5de2c6304dbf18586fb9897877b00b8464021eaa273a06873c7ddee42456141b899a35b762d51e254aedba5c0340ae32e9175678e7113ed65c91b4588cfd15b80faa907829d513a89a4bba5bed835\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3929db01a5a59f92d7ad1aa5fd5ec907def1a39fb12fa175d73a544c6d36a96d6fd78614ddfd5539ed0ed7a9f1cf2df4877f6e1983c01f4b96ed339aa3c4fa6e571e9f0635c742a56b58b271f646fab1e7ea5abcad2b304a8abf28cd69bea6d33859e256c1be314f328120a83aa833ec77ed6669060afe86\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c27b19d070131a4d7cb624a279d5b6f8844477cb8d793295b16319fdc093fe3eb19a76de0098dc8a8d9b993f3df40f6f68be5f32091944d694a38b8978e58c60da9d068c686325ff9e949279f988285e8a3e38f74e792425b23a1b530e496477d8a9e413553ecae43e1dbe28075f0413db4e2f0cd48f38ba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d20b3cf3c33d0535c357ce058a11edbaae8a16d394b98db00748ff3ad8ce5b7b272b814627626696a8b23e7d991e6e7f69514a20cc49f97a88dbf456c7b7118abc217d21aa11dbc92580b7cb1290569b61352c4241ce2416949daf6074c1ec1117f0b746b9ed0ff3f6bcc3f8fb4b0c6da98a75bf66ddc5b9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d858762d3e0997424995e27ff0de991de68f5de60919b31948c039109bd9fbc4ee56b287b8732743202bdc9c2179a16854aadb6a2314c988ceb9b65bbbd4cea0118ac631dc4f7bd3ba094bbe2264d4211cd2233b5aaa6ab0771bbf18380a519a3a3e7ff553dac8fa2f5f648d38ac54be2897bd30dc3b4804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5b80545e9bfd1b812661b5945689d4f77f062ce506adf5f2b4a9c3aec3bcbfa34c018928a534e2c74d9d9ef1651a2fb107c9189ef9cf3d244633edbcd45fa370b76691d0557d292470bc384c8d7d7bbf01ae9fbe7c2b0963ee2670\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b9ad0e58d8d9d6f97fa90c30b5707e163535d7f77e26c77019792291174861ea661c5258e0e04a6c8f9a65913ff35e32185c47458f0193b2f93bf8a0e47ec078850f8a995b4eef679cbae3a84a2967d9ca0da57e80688d27918c79565ce83bd3b39ff54df0fbf3a9a81a368973dfa2fc917dd72c54b7220b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dfe705abb3a3095d97eddf28053553a2d6a5ea3985a2ccb04474ad1d57a8b3830cb5cca8336a7a5b30a41ece39cb64c1b8be3dc48e59c29db486784a6e00c116278b7bc418b090c3a19daaf2f045eddf6bf57ce5b581e72af6af0b0e646222d6889c276f05fb4e2886aa25718fbe78186d63d5a2362a6d31\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4dcfd6a6c394e9ae0c886ae2ca2524ef883d727dc7e65fa5205f05ff6bc831c234933632fc605af05d80b8e4fc0d2949d00c0615d18ba8bd7b54e0f5228f47a738fbae79cbec434a543704de4c0746ccac360a04f2bef02d867d6c0120b5b1552d433dc903db6503e3fb98fed915a5c74153f38bd0d12253\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ac414c2ed1bfdd17afd9e53fe6bccce41eaa266b33b99ccf7f193dcb0b4fceda6597d589f5d7130ffca34c4b7749657b99dac91bcbb05c124a9bd7aea7b78fa3530d66b2f3af87c8c1204c85d97a5dda689daa5e8b1ff6695c81743b7b22cc84f63ed15dd56b16722fa83b1acc570ad39e25339972904dd2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9fbe3a9c86f6fc160399de0dbc762dd519ebd1aa0a80682d6e246bd6cdda579f1e7d1ee22580a80c7e83fd38a1dba90786c25d6aa7fb1172e6308b7509780fcc2283b627e171c5c2b36992f7c5d2bb76bc387f11dee484bfabc92a843a2356849344faefad0419a3b0d3195f78156a2bd60119c784e0238f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/345784fa190ad9fdac11c77e2e5bc387d39a7d1b11493a5848e9bc94c122c091f66838dea64f22aea0de3756c51b2ab22cf9a533261097e4c08ba35025871ccf49f18b4b4a9857c69fb842da2d8b18bec9f44d8ac31aeb1bfdf746aa720f676742a2eee17cd091fb626766b02872ecfe167ee6ab4a4df60e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ccd2a95537aae15ea670de59d0f110fd4e20ab9fa32ed1e22ea495d6423eab2473a1cedc16c8cdbc74da75affbd4a7ecb36088361b75ea8b3e66a6002258d808d803b54abd8d7527a8cc2ece8a0e4e47a1071881c4a1cfa8158b79105b4abf6e02f20c1086e73b6191c061114ac62a419eb6486a704969f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
